{
  "id": "buffons-needle-oq-02-oq-03",
  "name": "Abstract Cauchy-Crofton formula for arbitrary kinematic measures in ℝⁿ",
  "status": "completed",
  "knowledge": {
    "insights": [
      "The entire polygonal Cauchy-Crofton formula follows from integral_add by list induction — linearity of expectation is the only tool needed beyond the single-segment axiom",
      "simp_rw (not rw) is required for rewriting under integral binders in MeasureTheory",
      "Step-2 recurrence α_{n+2} = (n/(n+1))·α_n follows from the step-4 recurrence by push_cast; ring for n≥2, and direct norm_num for n=1",
      "Real.pi_lt_3141593 was removed from Mathlib v4.26.0; Real.pi_lt_315 is the correct bound to use (used in several gallery proofs)",
      "Pattern matching in structural recursion requires explicit absurd cases for unreachable branches (| 0, h => absurd h (by omega))",
      "Abstract formulation reveals Buffon 2D/3D are special cases of the same framework; shape independence is purely algebraic"
    ],
    "builtItems": [
      "AffineHyperplane n: type alias EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) × ℝ for {x : ⟪x,ν⟫ = c}",
      "LineSegment.crossing: indicator function for endpoint-opposite-sides crossing test",
      "totalCrossings / totalLength: list sums for polygonal paths",
      "integrable_totalCrossings: integrability by list induction",
      "cauchy_crofton_polygonal: main theorem E_μ[crossings(P)] = α_n · length(P) by induction + integral_add",
      "crofton_shape_independence: equal arc length implies equal expected crossings",
      "crofton_append: additivity under path concatenation",
      "crossingFactor_step2: α_{n+2} = (n/(n+1))·α_n for n ≥ 1",
      "crossingFactor_succ_succ_lt: strict decrease α_{n+2} < α_n for n ≥ 1",
      "kinematic_two_more_informative: 2D kinematic measure gives more expected crossings than 3D",
      "Dimension comparison chain: α₅ < α₄ < α₃ < α₂ proved using pi_lt_four, pi_gt_three, pi_lt_315",
      "Gallery entry: src/data/proofs/buffons-needle-oq-02-oq-03/"
    ],
    "mathlibGaps": [
      "Kinematic measure on space of affine hyperplanes (rotation+translation invariant measure on SE(n)/SE(n-1))",
      "Cauchy-Crofton property as a theorem from motion invariance (need Haar measure on SE(n))",
      "Grassmannian measure theory for integral geometry in Mathlib"
    ],
    "progressSummary": "COMPLETED: Abstract Cauchy-Crofton formula formalized with 3 axioms, 0 sorries, 27 theorems, 286 lines. Proves E_μ[crossings] = α_n · length for any polygonal path via linearity of expectation.",
    "nextSteps": [
      "Build kinematic measure from Haar measure on SE(n) to eliminate kinematicMeasure axiom",
      "Prove cauchy_crofton_segment from rotation invariance to eliminate that axiom",
      "Extend to smooth curves via C¹ approximation in arbitrary dimension"
    ]
  },
